 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nNorthwind Trading Inc                                              MASTER SERVICES\n1200 Industrial Parkway, 62701 Springfield, United States                  AGREEMENT\nVAT No: US14-0458158\n\nFROM                                                                     BILL TO\n\nNorthwind Trading Inc                                                   Northwind Trading Inc\n1200 Industrial Parkway                                                 450 Madison Avenue\n62701 Springfield                                                       80201 Denver\nUnited States                                                           United States\nVAT: US14-0458158\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 03/04/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Northwind\nTrading Inc, with its registered office at 1200 Industrial Parkway, Springfield (\"Party A\"), and Northwind Trading Inc, with its registered\noffice at 450 Madison Avenue, Denver (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of England and Wales.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A      Northwind Trading Inc / David Kim\nParty B      Northwind Trading Inc / Sarah Mitchell\nDate         03/04/2026",
